<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n114890" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">χρῡσό-κολλος</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ον</span>,
			<div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>soldered</i> or
				<i>inlaid with gold,</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐκπώματα</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					S.
					<u>Fr.</u>
					378
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κώπη</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					E.
					<u>Fr.</u>
					587
				</span></i>
			; also <b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">χρῡσο-κόλλητος</span></b> 
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">δίφρος</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Id.
					<u>Ph.</u>
					2
				</span></i>
			, cf. <i><span class="en">
				Antiph.
				106.2
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				237
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Luc.
				<u>Ind.</u>
				29
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἅρματα</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Jul.
					<u>Or.</u>
					2.50d
				</span></i>
			; cf. <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">χρυσοδακτύλιος.</span></div>
